{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261117/photo/bkn-20261117103246118-1117_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261117133032\"/><p>石硤尾邨有人倒斃單位內。</p><p>石硤尾有人倒斃單位內。今日(17日)早上9時32分，石硤尾邨保安員報案，指21座一單位傳出異味。人員接報到場，消防破門而入，發現一名男子倒臥在單位内，經檢驗證實當場死亡，姓葉(65歲)男子死因有待驗屍後確定。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T05:49:26.261090+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":125,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T02:32:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T09:45:15.177384+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T05:42:45.385827+00:00","content_hash":"f57e2737a7e7c587a9d32f1794c85b9aa1ce7b61509a57df4ce7322b827281be","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}